## 7. Don'ts

- Don't add accounts, matchmaking, chat, or online modes other than Quick Battle.
- Don't send gameplay traffic through Cloudflare.
- Don't special-case a fighter id in shared code, and don't change movement numbers or controller comfort rules.
- Don't edit `character_rule`.
- Don't change how offline modes (Quick Battle vs CPU, Watch, Local, Practice) play. The existing tests and `verify:itch` must pass unchanged.
- Don't commit secrets. The server needs none for this version.
